( What next? An extinctionist game with Demo, Geryon and Dispater killed?
Or an ice box ascension? )

Life without obsessions is meaningless.
It was a dark and a gloomy night, and the stars were aligned
properly. 
Nostalgia.suroot.com, a server of the game of NetHack. An (amateur)
extinctionist was born.
I started playing this particular game a couple of weeks back,
and as the game started to go well, I decided I'd try to make it
an amateur extinctionist game. It affects your mind!
Then the server crashed, followed by the crash of my game. A big thanks
goes to Thorwak for making it all good again!

^-^

I like orcish wizards; they get better st than elvish wizards...
and the initial poison resistance is nice. The early game was pretty
much normal; I went to Sokoban first to get a "oReflection, collected
daggers. My early game armor was studded leather armor, elven boots
and some helmet. As usual, my pet decimated the Minetown Watch so I got
leather gloves and a small shield. 

Minetown temple was co-aligned.

I bought a magic lamp at Izchak's, iirc (or maybe I just found it). I
blessed with fresh holy water. I think I got Magicbane rather early
at dlvl 2 or 3 by saccing low-level monsters, only to get it destroyed
much, much later in the old "bag of tricks to BoH" - trick.
I cashed theh lamp for SDSM. In Castle I wished for BoH, not having had
any other container.

Ludios, along with an altar(!) was on level 19.

The rest was the continous act of summoning and killing monsters, right? Not!
(Boulders are set as "0")


